      ‖U - Rperm (sBD n D) (tBD n D)
        (dftM (sBD n D) (fun k => (2 : ℂ)⁻¹ ^ (bP n + 2) * ubar C x k))‖ ≤ EsN n D * hp (pP n) ∧
